<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korint</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korint</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 NWER NYI POL NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt2">ANEB ERO BA LI GO</para>
  <para style="mt1">KORINT</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Me Pol wo, ji koro Esowo, á yehk-m no re me n jol ntiingetib no Kraist Jisos, awahr a mmonannee Sostenes, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />e kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv aneb Esowo ba li go Korint, bao ba Kraist Jisos ma ru ntim ebo, fere yehke bo re bo jol ebo ebo ka Esowo, budu ane bao ba kpꞌkake ero edi ajehng ajehng go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist ji li ntul abo, a ntul ewahre fvfo.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nong, Esowo Nso ejahre, a Ntul a Jisos Kraist ka-n nnoobo, a elkoono.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elfuulu ni Kraist kpo fuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />N kpo kak Esowo saam ngare anyehng anyehng tib wahn, tib go nnoobo nyi Esowo ma-n ka, eji á ka-r Kraist Jisos. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Tib eji ń li ajehng a Jisos, owo wahnge ḿ ma fang go alum abungu kpee, a elkahne anehng anehng. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Alum nya Kraist nya wob-n go egahne atahng ebgbal, fere tahne. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Ano wo wahnge nnoobo anyehng anyehng nyi Esowo ka-r no kil-n ebkpe rin, ana ń kpꞌsiki re bo lennge Ntul a Jisos Kraist ka-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tait 2:13</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Á bahk-n kuuru tete rehng go esꞌkohro efung, eji ń lꞌli eno go efung bio bi Ntul a Jisos Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 1:6</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Tibre Esowo kpi ekakesehk, ye ji yehk-n no re wahn ba jol ajehng a Mmon ewe Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 3:3</char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elyabe ni aneb ero yabe no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />N kp-n rehke abonanee go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist re wahn ane kpee jo bung, bum nnyo amehng, nyꞌyabe anyehng anyehng kꞌkpe jol go egahne ellong. Sahb jolen jol ajehng go eltim anehng, a ntir anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:2</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Tibre, abonanee, ane ba li etahk Kloe ma-m tong re, wahng kpꞌtaange atemtem. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ellum ni n kpꞌbungu a, n kpꞌbungu bade ane bandiki ba kpo bung re, bo li ka Pol, bandiki re, bo li ka Apollos, bandiki re, bo li ka Pita, bako re, bo li ka Kraist.<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Anv, Kraist ebyab, jol agꞌgabe agꞌgaba? Pol wo bo kum-e go ekros ka-na? Anv, wahn bele ewohngalahb go mbing nyi Pola? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Me n kak Esowo saam, eji n ki wohngo nne awohng awohng ewahne alahb, sehngem Krispus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 18:8</char></note> a Gayus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:23</char></note> bo ba n wohngo bo alahb. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Nnene limm, no bahke ma bung re á bele ewohngalahb go egama mbing. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Oo, n tꞌtob wohngo Stefanas alahb fvfo, a aneb etahk ebe. N nehme kpe buumu, joare n kpꞌkpe wohngo nne nondiki alahb budu. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Tibre Kraist me tumem re me m ba wohngo ane alahb. Á tum-m re me n song tiingi nnoobo etib. Limm re me m bung ana nne no kpo mal alum abungu go elkahne ni ane, tib eji nsahm nyi elkv ni Kraist kpo no go ekros lꞌkꞌgbod.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 2:4</char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kraist wo li nsahm, a elkahne ni Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Alum nyao nya li bade ekros ji Kraist kpoo no, li agboolo nsol go ejang ane bao ba kpꞌtane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 4:3</char></note> Go egahre ejang, wahr jia ji kpꞌbele eltahre, alum nyao li nsahm nyi Esowo. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Tibre bo nyono go nwer Esowo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">M bahke rannge elkahne ni akahnkahn ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">fere yehke ntir nyio nyi aneb ngbere, ro go.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Anv, kehm jolo renan bade akahnkahn ane bao, a aneb ngbere fvfo? Kehm jolo renan bada nne no kpo ware go nnyo go njini nyia? Esowo ebrod elkahne ni njini nyia bum ana egboolo ejum.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Tibre Esowo go ege elkahne wo, á kpane ane re bo ki-e kahn go bo elkahne. Kpo kor Esowo re á tahre ane ba lꞌtaame tv etib bi e kpo tiingi, bi kpo jol ane bako ana egboolo ejum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:25</char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Jus kpo seb re bo nyehn akpokosi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:38</char></note> Grik kpo seb elkahne. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ana wahr, wahr kpo tiingi etib bi Kraist ji bo kum-e go ekros. Go ejang bi Jus, etib bia li ana esiti mbang. Go ejang bi ane ba ki li Jus, li egboolo ejum. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Go ejang ane bao ba Esowo ma yehke bo, bo li ma jol Jus, bo li ma jol ane baka baka, etib bia ana, Kraist wo, ji li nsahm nyi Esowo, a elkahne. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Etib bio bi Esowo, bi kpo jol egboolo ejum go esamahr ane, nobo sehnge elkahne ni ane. Nsol nyio nyi Esowo nyi kpo jol aleenge nsol go esamahr ane, tahne sehnge eko ji ane.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Abonanee, buumen ana ń jolo no, eji Esowo lung-n no. Egom ejahne ntiil ji jolo akahnkahn ane. Egom ejahne ntiil ji jolo ajꞌjok ane, fere jol agburu ane ba bele ellub go njini nyia. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Esowo ebyehke nsol nyi li agboolo nsol go esamahr njini nyia ko, riki akahnkahn ane ndon, fere yehke nsol nyi kil tahne go esamahr njini nyia, ko, riki ajꞌjok ane ndon.<verse eid="1CO 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Esowo ebyehke nsol nyi li rede rede, nyi kil jo lub ane ba li go njini nyia, nyi bo kpo fere bung re, “Ejumjum o lohngem!” Eji á lꞌrede nsol nyi njini kpo tir re li atahntahn nsol, eji lꞌkꞌkpe jol ejumjum.<verse eid="1CO 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Jia lohngo re, nnene limm, no bahke ma wor nnyo go esamahr bi Esowo. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ye wo ka-n Jisos Kraist, eji ń lꞌjol go elkpin nꞌne. Kraist wo, Esowo m-e ko, lim-r e ma jol akahnkahn, fere li eno go ege esamahr, fere jol ejahre ejahre. Ye wo ma-r fak yake. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Ano wo fvfo bo nyono go nwer Esowo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:31">“Nne no lꞌkehme nnyo wor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:31">á wor nnyo tib go nsol nyi Jehova ma lim.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Etib bi li bade Kraist ji bo kum-e go ekros</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Abonanee, eji m ba go egahne ba yiimi ntianse ka Esowo, n joom bung ayebeyebe alum, fere jo bung go elkahne nehka nehka. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />N tiri go egame eltim re, n nehm kpe bung ejum ajehng ajehng jehka jehka tong-n, m bahke jo bung bade Kraist wo wo, asehngesehnge elkv ene ni m bahke jo ga bung.<verse eid="1CO 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Eji n jolo a nahne, n leenge sehng, jo fahl, fere jo kꞌkahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:14</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Etib bi n tiingi no, a alum nya m bungu no, m bungem ana nne no kpo sahb mꞌmal elbungu go elkahne ni nne. N fere jo tib nsahm nyio nyi etohko ji Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 1:5</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />goji eltaame enahne lꞌkꞌkuumu go elkahne ni nne, eji lꞌkuumu go nsahm nyi Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elkahne ni Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Tibre alum nya n kpo bung kpi elkahne ka ane ba ma gbal go ejang bi Esowo. Elkahne nia lohngem go njini nyia. Elkahne nia limm elkahne ni ane ba kpi njini nyia fili, bo jio ji bahke tane. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Elkahne ni n kpꞌbungu a, elkahne ni Esowo ni, ni ki li gbuul, ni Esowo behre no. Bomo go mbomannahb, njini kehm jolo, Esowo yehke elkahne nio re jol ellub nꞌnahre. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ntul awohng awohng limm go njini nyia, no kahne elkahne nia. Li re bo kꞌkahn, kehn bo jolem kumu Ntul no kpi ellub go ekros.<verse eid="1CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Nwer Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;&lt;Nsol nyi nne kala nyꞌnyehn, fere wꞌwuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">nyi nne kala tꞌtir go ege eltim re bahke jolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">nyi nyi Esowo ma toobo bum ane bao ba ye kpi bo kor,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />nyꞌnehm nyi Esowo ma lennge ka-r go ege etohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:11</char></note> Tibre etohko ji Esowo ji kpo rab ejum ajehng ajehng, fere jo rab nsol Esowo nyi li go mbiiri.<verse eid="1CO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nne, etohko eje ji ji kpꞌkahne kpee bade ana á li no. Ano wo fvfo, etohko ji Esowo kpꞌtob kahn kpee bade Esowo. Nnene limm, no kpꞌkahne. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Wahr belem etohko ji njini nyia ana, e bele etohko ji Esowo tumu no tv, eji e lꞌkahn ayare nya Esowo ma-r ka. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />E kpehme bung alum nya nne tib-r no go ege elkahne. E kpo bung alum nya Etingi Etohko tib-r no, eji e kpꞌtooro nsol nyi etohko, tong ane bao ba kpi etohko ji Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Nne noka noka no ki kpi etohko ji Esowo, á nehm ma bel nsol nyi etohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:47</char></note> Tibre á nehm tiki kahn, eji li agboolo nsol go ege esamahr. Tibre elkahne nio ni nne bahke kahne nsol nyio, elkahne ni etohko ni. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Nne no kpi etohko jio ona ji Esowo, á bahke ma lam elam ajehng ajehng. Yefono antahng, nnene limm, no bahk-e ma lam.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Nwer Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nne awo li nne no kpꞌkahne ntir nyi Jehova,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">nyi á bahk-e tubu elle?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 11:34</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Wahr ba kpi ntir nyi Kraist.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Alokeltum Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Abonanee, etingitingi, m maam bung a nahne ana n jol bungu a ane ba kpi etohko ji Esowo. M bungu a nahne ana n jol bungu a ane ba njini nyia, a abonbili ba li go ejang bi Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:12</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />N jo le-n go alahbbel, wahn n joom le go nsol alehke nyehka ga nyi kpꞌtahne. Tibre ń joom ma li. Jol tete sik anv, ń nehme ma li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 5:12-13</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Tibre ń kpeke li na li jang jang ana ane baka baka. Ń lꞌfere bel eteelala atemtem, fere jo taange, jia nehme tib re ń kpꞌlimi eljini ni ane baka baka ba li njini nyiaa?<verse eid="1CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Nne noka lꞌtong re, ye li ka Pol, noko re, ye li ka Apollos, lohngem re ń kpꞌlimi eljini ni ane baka bakaa?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Nne awo li li Apollos? Nne awo li li Pol? Bo alokeltum Esowo ba, bo ba wahnge ń taame tv Esowo. Bo, nne awohng awohng kpꞌlimi eltum ni Ntul ka-e re á lim. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Me wo jo bahm, Apollos jo toomo alahb,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 18:24-27</char></note> Esowo bi kpo ka nlak. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Nne no kpo bahm nsol, a nne no kpo toomo alahb, ejumjum goji bo limm. Esowo ntahngtahng bi li elahmlahm ejum, tibre ye wo kpo ka nlak. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Nne no kpo bahm, a nne no kpo toomo alahb, bo li jang jang. Nne awohng awohng bahke bele eltuuru ene, ana á limi eltum. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Wahr ebkod abo, lim eltum ka Esowo. Wahn ba li edi egbe ji Esowo. Wahn tob li etahk ji Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Nnoobo nyi Esowo ma-m ka, nyi nyi m ma ko bum nnahb ekahme nyia, ana etingitingi nsehketahk no nno a nno. Nne noko kpꞌlange ero. Nong, nne awohng awohng jo kunu ekpu ana á kpꞌlange.<verse eid="1CO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Nnahb ekahme anyehng anyehng limm, nyi bo bahke kpe bum, sehngem nyi bo ma si bꞌbum, nyi li Jisos Kraist. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Egom jindiki bahke koko agul, fundiki asilva, fundiki atal nya nno a nno, lang kunu go nnahb ekahme nyio. Egom jindiki bahke koko ajang nti, fundiki amang, fundiki akomo si. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Eltum nne awohng awohng, bo bahke nyehne. Efung bio bi Kraist, agun nya bahke tibi ana eltum ni nne awohng awohng jolo no. Agun nyao bahke wuungu eltum anehng anehng, joare nꞌnob, afi nobem.<verse eid="1CO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji nne lꞌsi, kunu go nnahb ekahme nyio, lꞌsahb agun, nne noo wo bahke bele eltuuru. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Nne awohng awohng no eltum ene lꞌfi, yeblim eltum mbol mbol. Yefono antahng bahke bele eltahre ana nne no ma bohngo lohng go agun.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Anv, ń nehme kahn re, wahn ba li etahk ji Esowo, ji Etingi Etohko ma ba lene tob-na?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 6:16</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌrannge etahk ji Esowo, Esowo bahk-e tob rannge. Tibre etahk ji Esowo li mbarebare ejum ji li saang. Etahk jio, wahn ba.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Nong, nne awohng awohng kꞌnehm elne. Nne awohng awohng go egahne ellong no lꞌtong re, ye li ekahnkahn nne go njini nyia, nong, á fere jol egboolo nne, eji á lꞌfere jol ekahnkahn nne ji nno a nno. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Tibre elkahne ni njini nyia, go ejang bi Esowo li egboolo ejum. Ana nwer Esowo bungu re, “Á kpo bob akahnkahn ane go bo elkahne.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Edi nwer Esowo jehko kpe bung re, “Jehova kpꞌkahne re, ntir nyio nyi akahnkahn ane lohngem ejumjum.”<verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nong, nne awohng awohng kꞌgeere kak ejum ajehng ajehng ji nne. Ejum ajehng ajehng jia ana, jꞌjahne ji. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Pol, a Apollos, go Pita, njini nyia, elkpin, elkv, eying jia ji anv, a eying ji esꞌsong, kpee nsol nyia, nyꞌnyahne nyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:23</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Wahn, Kraist wo kpi-n. Kraist, Esowo bi kpi-e.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Abatiingetib Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Nobo re nne ko-r ana alokeltum Kraist, ba Esowo ma kak bo nsol enye go ebo, nyi á behre no. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ejum ajehng ji li ka nlokeltum li re, á jo lim ji nde tong-e no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:42</char></note><verse eid="1CO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Egame, m-e nehme lub, jol afi ḿ bungu renan bada name, afi njini nyia fvfo bungu renan bada name. Jol me n kpehme lam elname. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Jol n nehme kahn ebi ejum ji m ma lꞌlim. Jia lohngem re, me n li eno. Tibre Jehova ntahngtahng wo bahk-m lame. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Owo wahng ka nobo re wahn kꞌjo lam nne awohng awohng, ngare nyio kehm rehnge, nyi Ntul ewahre bahke bake. Nsol nyi li mbehr mbehr go ejannge, á bahke lohngo a nyi go edi ji li gbuul. Nsol nyi wob go ntim ane, á bahke lennge, nne awohng awohng nyehn. Owo Esowo bahke kehm tehke nne awohng awohng ana fuumu re á tehk-e.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Abonanee, esi ejahne ji wahnge n limi ntugare nyia bade Apollos a me, eji ń lꞌkpili ejum go egahre, ji li re, wahn kahn ana ḿ bahke jo jen, jang jang ana nwer Esowo bungu no. Nong, nne awohng awohng ewahne kꞌjo geere kak nne noko, fere jo daange nne noko.<verse eid="1CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Nne awo tong-a tong re wobnob sehnge ate eba? Ejum aji a kpi no, ji ki li Esowo ka-a no? Anv, jen ji wahnge a kpꞌworo nnyo kunu ejum ji a kpi no? Esowo sang ka-aa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:6</char></note><verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Anv, wahn ebbel ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń kpꞌsebe. Wahn ebfang, wahn ebfere jol atul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:17</char></note> Wahr ka jol.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 4:8">Kp-m koro re, wahn lohko jol atul, goji wahr lꞌtob jol atul a nahne a nahne. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Li re Esowo ma-r lim re, wahr jol akahlenjahm ane, wahr ji li abatiingetib ebe, ana ane ba bo kpꞌgohro lam esꞌkohro elam ji bo bahke wulu bo. Tibre bo kp-r sono go elkab ane, fere son-r go esamahr bi babenjel, a esamahr ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:36; Hib 10:33</char></note><verse eid="1CO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Wahr agboolo ane ba tib go esi ji Kraist. Wahn akahnkahn ane ba go ejang bi Kraist. Wahr li lenge lenge, wahn kpꞌtahne. Wahr, bo kpo daang-r daange, wahn, bo jo kak-n.<verse eid="1CO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Tete sik anv, e kpo jen njal njal, alahb fere jo kor-r. E kpo kak ajakensol go ngubjing. Bo kpo dv-r. Ekehnge ajehng ajehng e kpimm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 11:23-27</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />E kpo sahb lꞌlim eltum abo gbalee, jo le elnahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:33-34</char></note> Bo lꞌsu-r, e kpo biri nnoobo tv bo. Bo lꞌnohk-r, afi bo lim-r ejum ajehng ajehng, e kpo kpꞌkpuumu. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Bo lꞌkiimi afahnge lak-r, e faange bo go mbang nyi e bahke koono. Wahr ebjol ana nkahr nyi njini nyia, fere jol ana akpake mbang tete rehng anv.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Eji n kpꞌnyono ana tv-n, lohngem re n kpꞌsebe re me n rik-n ndon. N kp-n kake na erehke ana abon ebame antahng antahng. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Afi ḿ bele atꞌtibi gbalee ba ki li go nfange, ń kpi nde awohng. Me n jol nso ejahne tib go alum nya Kraist Jisos nya m bungu no tong-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:19</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />N kp-n gboongo re, wahn toono eljini ename.<verse eid="1CO 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Owo wahnge m ma tum Timoti tv-n, ye ji kpi ekakesehk. Ye wo li ekorokoro mmon ewame go ejang bi Ntul a Jisos. Ye wo bahk-n buumu ana eljini ename li no go ejang bi Kraist. Nsol nyi o, nyi n kpo tib go ero abehng abehng bi li edi ajehng ajehng.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Egom ejahne jindiki ebkehme elgeere. Bo kpꞌtiri re, me n nehme kpe ba go egahne. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />M bahke gulu elbake go egahne, Jehova lꞌtaame. Owo m bahke ba seb antahng kahn elkohn nsahm ana nyi aneb elgeere bao kpi no, jol alum nnyo ebo sang. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Etul bi Esowo limm ejum ji nne bahke bungu go nnyo a nnyo, li na ejum ji nne bahke tibi nsahm.<verse eid="1CO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Anv, jen ji ń kpꞌsebe? Me m ba go egahne ebti go eboa, afi me m ba go elkoro ana nnaanga nne?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Erehbe bi nne ero limi no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Nne awohng awohng ebwuk re, nne noa, wob go egahne ellong, no ma lim erehbe ana bio bi jol ane ba ki nyi Esowo kala lꞌlim. Tibre bo tong-m re, nne awohng go egahne ellong kpo noongo a nkal a nde.<verse eid="1CO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Bahke limi renan, ń kehm gꞌgeere? Ji ga nob li re, wahn jo guunu. Yehken ye jio ji ma lim elkohn ejum ana jio go egahne ellong! <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Jol afi go ngubjing n li fee, etohko ejame li a nahne o.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:5</char></note> Me n lam nne noo no limi elkohn ejum ana jio go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos, ana n jolo na o a nahne. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ana ń kpo kono asi edi ajehng, n kpo tob ba jol a nahne o go egame etohko. Nsahm nyi Ntul a Jisos nyia, a nahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 13:10</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Owo nobo re, wahn yake nne noo, kak nnehm go ebo, goji ngubjing enye lꞌrannge, etohko eje lꞌfere bel eltahre efung bio bi Ntul a Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:20</char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Elgeere enahne ni ń kpꞌgeere nobem. Ń ka wuk a wuk elgan ni bungu re, “Abonsꞌsohko amohk ayist kpo lim ebred kohro kohro tunga?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:9</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Nobo re wahn yehke nkꞌkulu eyist nyio nyi abiafem, eji ń lꞌjol ebred ji nfenfe, ji ki kpi etoongo eyist ajehng ajehng. N kpꞌkahne re, ń lohko li go etingitingi. Tibre Kraist ji li mmon a njoro no Pasova ejahre, ye wo, bo m-e rod lim njom. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Nong, wahr kꞌko ebred jio ji kpi nkꞌkulu eyist nyio nyi eblum alimi, a abꞌbi, li elkak nio. Nong, wahr ko ebred ji ki kpi eyist, li elkak nio. Ebred jio ji li saang, ji li etingitingi.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Go egame nwer nyi n nyono tv-n, n nyono re, wahn kꞌjo kod abo, lim ejum ajehng ajehng a ane ba kpo noongo a ane. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />N nehme bung bade ane baka baka, ba kpo noongo a ane, ba li go njini nyia, ane ba kpo baare amahr go nsol ane, a awajv, go abajomeblom. Re wahn kehm lohngo go ellong ane bao, kehn ḿ bahke lohngo go njini nyia abo akpade akpade, tahm edi jimongo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:15</char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Nwer nyi n nyono tv-n, n nyono re, wahn kꞌjo kod abo, lim ejum ajehng ajehng a nne no kpo tong re, ye mmonanne ejahne wo, fere jo noongo a ane, jo baare amahr go nsol ane, jo jom eblom, fere jo kiimi afahnge lake ane, jo wo amahm, jo v ejv. Kana jo li nsol alehke a elkohn nne noo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 3:6; Tait 3:10; 2 Jon 10</char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Tibre limm ka-m re, me n jo lam ane baka baka. Aneb ero ba, nobo re wahn jo lam bo. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Esowo bi kpo lam ane baka baka. Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re, “Kamen ebi nne yehke go egahne ellong!”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Alam nya aneb Esowo kpo kak aneb Esowo bako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Nne awohng awohng no nfem lꞌgbo bo a mmonannyehn, á bahke sahbe song kak-e elam goji ane baka baka ba ki li aneb Esowoa? Nong, aneb Esowo toobo nfem nyio o.<verse eid="1CO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ń nehme kahn re, aneb Esowo ba bahke lame njini nyia aa? Lꞌfere jol re wahn ba bahke lame njini nyia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:21</char></note> jen ji wahnge ń lꞌkꞌma toobo abon afem ana bao? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ń nehme kahn re wahr ba bahke lame babenjela? Jia bahke jolo renan, eji ń kil ma toobo abon nsol ba njini nyia a?<verse eid="1CO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Anv, nfem ana nyio lꞌgbo, jen ji wahnge ḿ bahke yake ka ane bao ba ki wob ero, ba kil jo lub aneb ero? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ndon a nahne! Anv, lohko li re, nnene limm go egahne ellong no kpꞌkahne ana á bahke ma toobo nfem nyi ma gbo go ellong aneb Esowoa? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Anv, nꞌnob re mmon Esowo noko kak mmon Esowo noko go esuba, eji ane baka baka lꞌlam-ea? <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Jol nobem na re wahn kak atemtem go elam. Ga nob re wahn taame go ebi ji bo ka-n mbol mbol, nyehn erem, fere taame re bo taare nsol enyahne ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:39</char></note><verse eid="1CO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Wahnfono antahng kpo soodo ane, fere taare bo nsol go eko, jol abonane ebahne ń kpo lim bo ano. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ń nehme kahn re, abi ane nehm yel ejahbetul Esowoa? Kana jo nehm elnahne! Ana ane bao ba kpo noongo a ane, abajomeblom, abalimerehbe, ane ba kpo lim abꞌbi nyao nya bo kpo noongo atemtem, nya aneblum kpo noongo atemtem, anebkal noongo atemtem, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />awajv, ane ba kpo baare amahr go nsol ane, anebe nwꞌwoko, ane ba kpo kiimi afahnge lake ane, a ane ba kpo taare ane nsol go eko, bo nehm tiki yel go ejahbetul Esowo. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Egom ejahne jindiki jolo elkohn ane bao. Anv, Esowo ebru ntim enyahne, wahn ebjol ejahne ejahne ka Esowo, wahn ebli eno go esamahr Esowo tib go mbing nyi Jisos Kraist ntul ewahre, a etohko ji Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agubjing enyahne li ka Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Nne nondiki li ma tong re, “N li ma lim ejum ajehng ajehng, nsahde limm.” Nsol kpee sang kpo kak nne ebo. Etingitingi, n li ma lim ejum ajehng ajehng, sehngem re, n nehme seb re, me n jol nju go eyaame ajehng ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:23</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Nne nondiki li ma bung re, “Nsol alehke li ka ala, ala li ka nsol alehke.” Esowo bahke limi nsol ebal ebal nyio tan. Ngubjing limm ka abꞌbi, li ka Jehova. Jehova tob li ka ngubjing.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 3:16; 1 Tes 4:3-5</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Esowo bi nyahme Ntul a Jisos go elkv, á bahke tob nyahm-r go ege a nsahm.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ń nehme kahn re, ngubjing enyahne li ejum ngubjing nyi Kraista?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 12:27</char></note> Anv, nꞌnob re me n ko ejum ngubjing nyi Kraist, kono edi ajehng a ngubjing nyi nne asꞌsaa? Nobem ano!<verse eid="1CO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ń nehme kahn re, nne no noongo a nnenkal asꞌsa, bo li ngubjing anyehnga? Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re, “Ane abal bao bahke fere jol ajehng.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Nne no lꞌya laake Ntul a Jisos, á li ajehng a ne go etohko. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Jahngen asꞌsa! Tibre abiafem nyako kpee lim ka ngubjing. Nne no lꞌlim abiafem nyao nya á noongo a nne, á limi tob ngubjing enye.<verse eid="1CO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Anv, ń nehme kahn re, ngubjing enyahne nyi li etahk ji Esowo, ji Etingi Etohko lene no, ji Esowo ma-n kaa? Ń kpimm elnahne antahng. Esowo bi kpi-n no. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Á gun-n ka ekun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:18-19</char></note> Owo nobo re wahn ka Esowo ellub go egahne agubjing.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Abahbe nya li bade elbal akoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Anv, n yahke bung bada nsol nyi ń nyon-m no go egahne nwer. Nobo re nnenlum jol, kꞌbel nkal. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Tib go enoongo ane ji ane kpo kono elgboko yel, nnenlum awohng awohng nobo re á bel nkal. Nnenkal awohng awohng nobo re á bal nlum.<verse eid="1CO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Nlum a nne fuumu re á jo fili nkal ewe nob nob. Nkal a nne fuumu re á jo fili nlum ewe nob nob. Nne awohng awohng jo ka ntem ajehng ajehng ji á sebe no. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Nnenkal sang li nfona ngubjing enye. Nnenlum wo kpi. Nnenlum sang li nfona ngubjing enye, nnenkal wo kpi. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Kana jo lahm atemtem elnong, sehngem re no, ń tohko toobo na re, wahn lim ano mmongare ntiil, eji ń lꞌbel ngare nyi ḿ bahke jo kak ero. Owo nobo re wahn fere ba kono, eji nnehm lꞌkꞌba, ba gar-n. Tibre ń nehm ma bob elnahne antahng. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Alum nya m bungu a, m bungem na ana ntahm. M bungu tibre n kpꞌkahne re nne li lenge lenge.<verse eid="1CO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Kor-m kor re nne awohng awohng jol ana me n li no. Nne awohng awohng kpi akahmekahme ayare nya Esowo m-e ka. Nne noko kpi elkohn ayare nyaka, noko kpi elkohn ayare nyako.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 19:12</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Alum nya n yahke bung a, n kpꞌbungu tong aneblum ba kala ko akal, a anebkal ba kala bal alum, go akalebun. Nobo ka bo re, bo sa ano, ana me n li no. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Bo tohko sahb ji ano, fuumu re aneblum ko akal, anebkal bal alum. Ga nob re nnenlum ko nkal, nnenkal bal nlum, sehnge re nnenlum jo gbo ngbabohngo a nnenkal, nnenkal jo gbo ngbabohngo a nnenlum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 5:14</char></note><verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Alum nya n yahke bung a, n kpꞌbungu tong aneblum ba ma bel akal, a anebkal ba ma bal alum. Alum nya n yahke bung a, nyanyame sang, nya Jehova nya, nya li re, nnenkal, bo kꞌyaame abola nlum ewe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:32</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Tohko jol ano, á sa ano ntahngtahng, tohko fere jol ano, á feere goji nlum ewe. Nnenlum kꞌkam nkal ewe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Alum nya n yahke bung a, Jehova sang bungu no, mefono antahng wo kpꞌbungu tong egom ane bako re, nne awohng awohng no ma bel nkal, no ki li nne Esowo, nnenkal noo lꞌfere taame re á bahke jolo a ne, nobem re á kam-e. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nnenkal Esowo awohng awohng no ma bal nlum no ki li nne Esowo, nnenlum lꞌfere taame re á jol a ne, nobem re nnenkal noo be-e sa. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Nnenlum no ki li nne Esowo, Esowo m-e ko ano, tib go esi ji nkal ewe. Nnenkal no ki li nne Esowo, Esowo m-e ko ano, tib go esi ji nlum ewe no li nne Esowo. Tohko jol ano abon ebahne nehm jol ka Esowo. Tib go esi jio, Esowo ebko bo ano.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ye jio ji ki li nne Esowo lꞌseb re elbal nio mal, nong, jol ano. Mbang nyio o, nnenkal Esowo no elbal ma mal bo a nlum ewe, yebfor. Nnenlum Esowo no elbal ma mal bo a nkal ewe, yebfor. Tibre Esowo ma-r yehke re wahr jol go eyebatahng. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Nnenkal, a bahke limi renan kehm kahne, joare a bahke ma tahre nlum ewa? Nnenlum, a bahke limi renan, kehm kahne, joare a bahke ma tahre nkal ewa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 3:1</char></note><verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jol ana a jolo no ngare nyi Esowo lung-a no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Nong, nne awohng awohng jol ana Jehova ka-e no, ana á jolo no ngare nyi Esowo lung-e no. Nsol nyi ana, nyi n kpo tib go ero abehng abehng.<verse eid="1CO 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Nne awohng awohng no yehke nrur, Esowo kehm-e lungu, nong, á samme sa ano. Nne awohng awohng no ki yehke nrur, Esowo kehme lungu, nong, á kꞌkpe yehke nrur. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Afi nne yꞌyehke nrur, afi á yehkem, ejumjum limm. Ji li no li re, nne jo bum atahm Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:12; Gal 5:6; 6:15</char></note><verse eid="1CO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Nne awohng awohng jol ana á jolo ngare nyi Esowo lung-e no. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />A jolo nju, eji Esowo lung-a noa? Ka tiiri! A lꞌbel eyake ji a bahke foro, lim ano! <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Nne no Jehova lung-e no, no li nju, á li nne no ma for go ejang bi Jehova.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:32-36</char></note> Nne no ki jol nju ngare nyi Jehova lung-e no, ye nju nyi Kraist nyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:18,22</char></note><verse eid="1CO 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Esowo gun-n na, ka ekun. Kana fere jol aju ka ane. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Abonanee, elkohn anehng anehng ni n jolo no, Esowo kehm-n lungu, saan ano a Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abahbe nya li bade agol ane, a akalebun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Bade agol ane, ntahm anyehng anyehng limm, nyi m ma ko goji Jehova. M bahk-n tongo ji n kpꞌtiri, me jia ji Esowo ma-m lim re, ane jo bum-m go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:12</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Tib go etahntahn ngare ana nyia, me n tir re, nobo re nne sa ano ona, ana á li no. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />A kpꞌkpi nkala? Ka seb mbang ana nyi a bahk-e yehke elbal. Nne no kala bel nkal, á kꞌseb nnenkal. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />A lꞌfere ko nkal, abiafem anyehng anyehng a limem. Nnenkal lꞌbal nlum, abiafem sang á ma lim. Ane bao bahke jo kono afem nyaka nyaka bel, a erem. Kor-m kor re wahn kꞌjol ano.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Abonanee, jia m bungu tib eji ngare ki kpe li gbalee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:11</char></note> Bomo anv a asongo, nobo re ane ba ma bel akal, bo jol ana bo kala bel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 14:26</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Ane ba kpꞌguunu, nobo re bo jol ana ba kil guunu. Ane ba li go eyebatahng, nobo re bo jol ana ba ki li go eyebatahng. Ane ba kpo gunu nsol, nobo re bo jol ana ane ba ki kpi nsol.<verse eid="1CO 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Ane ba kpo lim nsol nyi njini nyia a, nobo re bo jol ana ane ba ki kpi nsol nyio nyi njini. Tibre njini nyia ana nyi li anv bahke tane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:15-17</char></note><verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Kp-m koro re, wahn kꞌgbo yel go atꞌtiiri nya nsol njini nyia. Nne no kala ko nkal kpo ga tiiri eltum Esowo, ana á bahke limi ji bahke Jehova kor. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Nne no ma bel nkal kpo ga tiiri nsol nyi njini, ana á bahke limi ji bahke nkal ewe kor.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:29</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Nnenkal no ma bal nlum, a nnenkal no kala bal nlum, elyaange nia. Nnenkal no kala bal nlum, afi ngbahme nyi, á kpo ga tiiri eltum Esowo, ana á bahke jolo saang go ngubjing, a etohko. Nnenkal no ma bal nlum kpo ga tiiri bada nsol nyi njini nyia, ana á bahke limi ji bahke nlum ewe kor.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />N kpꞌbungu alum nyaa re me n kak-n na ebo, lohngem re n kp-n kpane na. N kpꞌsebe re wahn sahb jꞌjol nob nob, eji ń lꞌsahb rꞌrod elnahne kpee ka Jehova, kꞌkpe jo kaake.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Nnenlum no ma lam elbal a mmongungu a nnenkal, eji kp-e sahb kꞌkor re á ko nkal, nnenkal lꞌfere kang sehnge ana á jol-e koko, nong, á ko-e ano, á jol nkal ewe. Abiafem sang na, á ma lim.<verse eid="1CO 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Nnenlum noo lꞌfere tir go ege eltim re, á nehm ko nkal, ana á bungu no nehm tiki kane, nnenkal no á ma lam elbal a ne, nong á jol, á ki-e kpe ko, ano wo á ma lim nob nob. Tibre ana kor-e no wo, á limi no, nnene we kpanem. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Nne no lꞌko nkal, á limi nob nob. Nne no tohko ko nkal, ye wo ga lim nob nob.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Nnenkal no kpi nlum, á ka for, eji nlum ewe kpeke li go elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:2</char></note> Nlum ewe lꞌkpo, yebfor. Á li ma kpe bal nlum awohng awohng no kor-e no, no li nne Esowo. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Egama ntir li re, á bahke bele eyebatahng sehng, á lꞌsa ano, ana á li no. N kpꞌbumu re, me fvfo n tob kpi etohko ji Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bada nsol alehke nyi bo ma ko jom eblom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Anv, bada nsol alehke nyi bo ko jom eblom, e kpꞌkahne re wahr ane kpee kpi elkahne. Elkahne kpo bum ane elgeere. Elkoro ni kpo lim ane gbal.<verse eid="1CO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtir re, ye kpꞌkahne ejum, á nehme kahn ana fuumu re á kahn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 6:3</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Nne no Esowo lꞌkor-e, Esowo kp-e kahne.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Bada nsol alehke nyi bo kpo ko jom eblom, e kpꞌkahne re, elom, ejum ji ane kpo fum ji, sehngem re Esowo na abehng bi li ejum. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Tibre nsol nyia tvv, nyi ane kpo lung re Esowo, nyindiki li go elbung, nyindiki li go ndi. Eblom ana bio bi ane kpo lung re Esowo, fere jo lung re Atul bia, lohko li go etingitingi. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Egahre, li Esowo na abehng abꞌbehng bi li Nso ejahre no limi nsol kpee, ye jio ji e li ka-e, go Ntul na awohng no li Jisos Kraist, ye jio ji wahnge nsol kpee kehm jolo, ye jꞌnehm ji kpꞌwahnge e kpꞌkpini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:16</char></note><verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Fvfo, nne awohng awohng sang kpꞌkahne etingitingi jio. Ane bandiki, eblom ajomo kpuuru bo sehng. Anv, bo lꞌkehme nsol alehke nyio li, bo kpo kpe tir re, nsol alehke nyio li ka eblom. Eji ntir atahng ebo kil ga tahne, owo eltim ebo kil eljolo saang.<verse eid="1CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nsol alehke, ebo abehng abehng wahr nehm kak go ejang bi Esowo. E tohko li, ejum ajehng ajehng limm, ji bahk-r tane. Afi e li na, nsehng anyehng anyehng limm, nyi bahk-r kake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:17</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Kunen ekpu go elforo nio ni ḿ ma for, eji lꞌkꞌwahng ka ane bako ba kala tahne, gbo yel go abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:13</char></note><verse eid="1CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Nne no ntir atahng enye kala tahne lꞌnyehn-a, wo ji kpi elkahne, a kpꞌlehke nsol go etahk elom, jio nehm tob lim-e re á tob li nsol alehke nyi bo ko jom ebloma? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ano wo elkahne ena bahke wahnge, nne no kala tahne kpo, tan, ye jio ji li mmonanne, no Kraist kpo, ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:15</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />A lꞌlim elkohn abiafem ni bahke rannge ntir atahng nyi abonane ebahne ba kala tahne, woblim abiafem, soodo Kraist.<verse eid="1CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Nsol alehke lꞌfere wahng mmonannee gbo yel abiafem, n nehm kpe li nnyam nkpel anyehng anyehng, eji me n lꞌkꞌjol nne no bahke wahnge mmonannee gbo yel abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:21</char></note><verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ntum nyi abatiingetib Jisos jo lim a ntuuru ebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Anv, me n limm nne no ma fora? Anv, me n ntiingetib a Jisos sanga? Anv, n ka nyehn Jisos Ntul ewahra?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 26:16</char></note> Wahn sang li eltuuru go eltum ename ni n kpꞌlimi ka Ntula? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Afi ane bako me kpehme bum ana ntiingetib a Jisos, wahnfono antahng kpꞌtaame re, me ntiingetib a Jisos wo. Tibre wahn ba li ane ba kpꞌtibi re, me n lohko li ntiingetib no Ntul a Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:2-3</char></note><verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ana wo n kpo kono elbungu yehke elname, ane lꞌkehm-m abahbe bahb.<verse eid="1CO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Anv, nobem re, bo jo ka-r nsol alehke, wahr lia, fere ka-r alahb, wahr wo go eltum ni e kpꞌlima? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Anv, fuumem re, wahr tob ko akala, jo tob yannge a bo, ana abatiingetib Jisos bako, a abonanyehn Ntul a Jisos, go Pitaa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 8:14</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Anv, Barnabas a me, wahr wahr ba bahke jo lim eltum go aboa, kehm jo bel nsol alehke lia?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Nne awo ma wꞌwuk bada nne a nsoja no kpo kpi elne akpohko go eltum nsoja ni á kpꞌlimi? Nne awo ma wꞌwuk bada mbahmgbe no kpo bahm egbe, kꞌli ejumjum go ege egbe? Afi wahn ebwꞌwuk bada mbaabebul no kpꞌbaabe ebul ebe, kꞌli nnyam a mbul?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Anv, alum nyaa n kpꞌbungu go egame ekoa? Anv, ntahm bungem ano jang janga? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Tibre bo nyono go atahm nya Moses re, “Kana jo gba nfong nnyo ngare nyi á kpi nkohl dv.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 5:18</char></note> Anv, Esowo kpo tiiri efonga? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Esi ejahre sang wahnge á bungu ellum nioa? Esowo nyono jio tib wahr. Nne no kpo bahm, a nne no kpo kpa, bo kpi ekunukpu re bo bahke bele eltuuru.<verse eid="1CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Eji e ma bahm amohk nti nyao nya etohko go egahne ellong, anv, nobem re wahn tuur-r eltuuru nehka nehkaa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 15:27</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Anv, ane bako lꞌbel nsahm nyi bo kpo ko nsol enyahne, wahr mee? Wahr ebyake nsahm enyahre bum go. Ga nob re wahr nyehn erem abehng abehng, sehnge re wahr gbahk eti, sahd mbang nyio nyi nnoobo etib bi Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:34-35</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Anv, ń nehme kahn re, ane bao ba kpo lim eltum go etahk Esowo kpo bel nsol alehke ebo oa? Ane bao ba kpo lim eltum ajom alimi, bo kpo bel eltahme. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ano wo fvfo Ntul a Jisos tongo re, ane ba kpꞌtiingi nnoobo etib, nong, bo bel nsol alehke o.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:7</char></note><verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Me n yake nsahm anyehng anyehng nyio bum go. N nehme nyon nwer nyia tv-n, eji ń lꞌjo ka-m nsol. Ga nob re me n kpo, sehnge re nne awohng awohng rannge elgahm ename nia. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Tibre elbungu ni n kpꞌbungu alum Esowo, me nehme ka ejum ajehng ajehng ji bahke wahnge n geere. Tibre li ka-m re me n tiki lim ano. Eyuu a name, n tohko kpe bung alum Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Li re eltum nia nꞌname ni, ni n yehke re me n lim, kehn m bahke jo kunu ekpu re me m bel eltuuru. Eji ki li eltum ename, nobo re me n lim ana bo kak-m go ebo re me n lim. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Anv, jen ji li eltuuru ename? Eltuuru ename li re, me m bung alum Esowo tong nne awohng awohng mbol mbol, kꞌjo kunu ekpu re me m bel nsol nyi li ka-m re me m bel go eltum ni alum Esowo abungu.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Me n li nne no ma for. N kpeem li nju, jol eji m ma rꞌrod elname ka nne awohng awohng ana nju, eji n lꞌga were ane tvv ka Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 20:26-27</char></note><verse eid="1CO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />N lꞌkehme eljene a Jus, n kpo tob jol ana nne a Jus, eji n lꞌmal were Jus ka Esowo. N lꞌkehme eljene a ane ba kpo bum atahm nya Moses, jol eji n ki wob go elwo nio ni atahm, n kpo tob jol ana mbumatahm, eji n lꞌmal were ababumatahm ka Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 21:26</char></note><verse eid="1CO 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />N lꞌkehme eljene a ane ba ki nyi atahm, n kpo tob jol ana nne no ki nyi atahm, eji n lꞌmal were ane bao ba ki nyi atahm ka Esowo. Jia lohngem re, n li na li, ntahm anyehng anyehng n kpimm go esamahr bi Esowo. Ntahm nyi Kraist nyi n kpꞌbumu.<verse eid="1CO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />N lꞌkehme eljene a ane ba kala tahne, n kpo tob jol ana bo, eji n lꞌmal were ane ba kala tahne ka Esowo. N kpo lim eljini ni nne awohng awohng, eji limi limi kan, n lꞌlub lim egom jindiki lub bel eltahre.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nsol nyia kpee n kpo lim tib go esi ji alum Esowo, eji n lꞌtob bel elfuulu ene.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ń nehme kahn eljini ni abahl abeka? Ane kpee ba kpo be, nne awohng wo kpo bel eltuuru. Been, goji ń lꞌbel eltuuru!<verse eid="1CO 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Mbekabahl awohng awohng kpo kuuru ngubjing enye, fere jo kunu elne ekpu go mbang anyehng anyehng, eji á lꞌbel ekpasi eltuuru ji bahke rannge na. Wo, wahr kpo tob lim eljini nio, eji e lꞌbel ekpasi eltuuru ji lꞌkꞌtiki rannge erannge rannge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 2:5</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />N nehme be na be, kꞌkahn edi ji n kpꞌbeke asongo re me n song rehng. N nehme fokko agbaji ana nne no kpꞌfohko agbaji nehme nehme. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />N kpo fili ngubjing enyame ana nde nne no kpo fili abon ebe nyaame nyaame. Tibre n nehme seb re me m bung alum Esowo tong ane bako, mefono antahng fere gbo.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade eblom ajomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Abonanee, n kpꞌsebe re me m buum-n re, babnso ejahre kpee woomo go nla ekparesemsem, fere jen sehng go Abilaya. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Bo bele ewohngalahb ji Moses go ekparesemsem, a aya mao, bo ane kpee. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bo jo li nsol alehke nyi etohko, bo ane kpee. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Bo kpee wo alahb mao ma etohko. Tibre bo jo wo alahb go ekpartal ji etohko ji jo jen a bo. Ekpartal jio ji jolo Kraist. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Jol tvtv ona egom ane jindiki gbalee, Esowo, atahng we joom yebe tob bo. Bo jo kpo go elka emahng, edi ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌje.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nsol nyio kpee nyi li erehke ka wahr, eji e lꞌkꞌjo kunu amahr enyahre go abꞌbi nsol nya bo jo lim. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kana jo jom eblom ana egom ebo jindiki jo lim. Ana bo nyono go nwer Esowo re, “Ane bao kehm jehke, jo li, fere jo wꞌwo, fere tahm, jo bahn ase.”<verse eid="1CO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Jol nong wahr kꞌjo famme yannge ana egom ebo jindiki limi no, toono o, efung abehng bo kpo ane atahltahl nkpel atahl abal, a nkpel elku ebal, a atahl awubu (23,000).<verse eid="1CO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Wahr kꞌjo gare Ntul a Jisos ana egom ebo jindiki jo gar-e. Enyo kehm kehme bo tokko wul.<verse eid="1CO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kana jo memme ana egom ebo jindiki jo memme. Nrꞌrannge kehm rannge bo kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 3:7-19</char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Nsol nyia kpee limi bo, eji lꞌjol elliingi ka-r. Nsol nyia kpee bo nyono, eji lꞌjol erehke ka wahr ji kpꞌsiki esꞌkohro ngare nyi yahke ba elkabbe. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Owo wahnge nne no lꞌbum re á yim na, nobo re á kunu ekpu, tohko jol ano á bahke gboko.<verse eid="1CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Elgaare anehng anehng limm, ni ma ba go egahne, ni kala bꞌba goji ane bako. Esowo kpehme kane enyam ebe. Owo wahng ka á lꞌkꞌlim elgaare gbal sehnge elwo enahne. Ngare elgaare nyio Esowo bahke limi eyake jio ji elbeke for, eji ń lꞌmal elkpuumu.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Akpondahme enyame, owo nobo re wahn yake eblom ajomo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:21</char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />N kpꞌbungu tong wahn ji kpꞌbange. Tiren antahng bade alum nya n yahke bung. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Nkob nyio nyi elfuulu nyi e kpo kak Esowo saam, fere wo, anv, tibem re wahr wob go ellong ane ba bo ma bak bo alung ma Kraista? Ebred ji e kpo kono elbakke, fere li, tibem re wahr wob go ellong ane ba bo ma bak bo ngubjing nyi Kraista?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 26:27; Elt 2:42</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Tibre li ebred na ajehng. Wahr kpee eji e li go egom, e li ngubjing anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:5</char></note> Tibre wahr kpee, bo ma-r bak ebred jio.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Nyehnen eljini ni anebe Israel jo kono ellimi. Ń nehme kahn re, ane bao ba jo li nsol nyi bo jo ko lim njom ka Esowo, bo jolo ajehng a edi njom alimi jioa?<verse eid="1CO 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Anv, jia lohngo renan? Anv, elom lꞌlohng ejuma, afi nsol alehke nyi bo kpo ko jom elom nyi lohngo ejum? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Eꞌee. Ji n kpꞌbungu li re, ajomjom nya ane ba ki nyi Esowo kpo jom, bo kpo jom ka eblehm. Bo kpehme jom ka Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 9:20</char></note> N nehme seb re wahn jol ajehng a eblehm. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ń nehm ma jo wo go nkob nyi Jehova, fere jo wo go nkob nyi eblehm. Ń nehm ma jo li nsol go ekpꞌkuru ji Jehova, fere jo li go ekpꞌkuru ji eblehm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 6:15-16</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Anv, e kpꞌsebe re wahr lim, ala jo teele Esowoa? Anv, e kpꞌtahne sehnge yea?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Ane bandiki kpo bung re, “Wahr ebfor. E li ma jo lim ejum ajehng ajehng ji kor-r no.” Ee, lohko li ano. Wo, nsol kpee sang kpo kak nne ebo. Wahr ebfor. E li ma jo lim ejum ajehng ajehng. Lohko li ano. Fvfo, nsol kpee sang li nsol nyi kpo lim nne gbal.<verse eid="1CO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Nne awohng awohng kꞌjo tiiri elne, nong, á jo tiiri nne noko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 15:2</char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Jo liin nnyam anyehng anyehng nyi bo kpo gungu go are. Kana jo tohko bahb, tib esi ji ntir atahng enyahne. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Tibre njini nyia kpee, a ejum ajehng ajehng ji li no, Jehova wo kpi.<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Nne no ki li nne Esowo lꞌtiing-a re wo je song li nsol alehke, jꞌjol re a bahke jeke, ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌka-a, li. Ka ji, bahb abahbe, tib esi ji ntir atahng enya. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Nne noo lꞌfere tong-a re, “Nsol alehke nyia, bo ko jom eblom,” ka li nsol nyio, tib go esi ji nne no tong-a no, a esi ji ntir atahng. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Lohngem re ntir atahng enya, nyi nne noko nyi. Nne nondiki li ma bahb re, “Jen ji wahnge n lꞌkꞌlim ana kp-m koro, tib esi ji ntir atahng nyi nne noko? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />N lꞌkak saam go nsol alehke enyame, jen ji wahnge nne nondiki bahke bungu ebꞌbi tob-m, eji n kpi nsol alehke enyame li, nyi n kake Esowo saam?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ajehng ajehng ji ń lꞌfere lim, afi ń li na, fere wꞌwo, limen, goji Esowo lꞌbel ellub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 3:17</char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Jolen nob nob, eji ń lꞌkꞌsoodo Jus, fere soodo Grik, fere tob soodo aneb Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:13</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Jo limen ana n kpo lim. N kpo seb re nne awohng awohng bel eyebatahng go ejum ajehng ajehng ji n kpꞌlimi. N kpehme seb re, jo nob a name. N kpo seb re, jo nob a ane bako, eji bo lꞌbel eltahre.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Toonen eljini ename jang jang ana n kpꞌtoono eljini ni Kraist.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana fuumu re anebkal jo bulu ejum go esi, bo lꞌkehme ero kak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />N kpo tehk-n, tibre ń kpo buum-m ngare anyehng anehng, fere toono eltibi ename ni n tib-n no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:17</char></note><verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />N kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn re, nne awohng awohng wob Kraist go elwo, nkal a nne wob nlum a nne go elwo. Kraist wob Esowo go elwo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:23</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Nnenlum awohng awohng no lꞌkak ero, afi á nyehne amahr nya Esowo, á lꞌbulu esi eje, yebdaange Kraist ji á wob-e go elwo. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Nnenkal awohng awohng no lꞌkak ero, afi á tob nyehne amahr nya Esowo, kꞌbulu esi eje, yebdaange nlum ewe, no á wob-e go elwo. Nnenkal noo li ana nnenkal no ma kpud esi eje. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Nnenkal no lꞌtong re á nehm bulu ejum go esi, nong, á kpud esi eje. Eji li ejum ndon re nnenkal kpud esi, nobo re á bulu na esi eje.<verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Fuumem re nnenlum bulu esi eje, eji á li efꞌtu ji Esowo, fere kpꞌtibi ellub ene. Nnenkal kpo tib ellub ni nnenlum. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Tibre nnenlum lohngem goji nnenkal. Nnenkal wo lohng na goji nnenlum. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Tibre Esowo limem nnenlum tib go esi ji nnenkal. Nnenkal wo, á lim-e no tib go esi ji nnenlum. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Owo wahng ka nobo re nnenkal jo bulu ejum go ege esi, tib go esi ji babenjel. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Go ejang bi Jehova, ki li nnenkal, kehn nnenlum jolem jo jini. Ki li nnenlum, kehn nnenkal jolem go jini. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Tibre nnenkal lohng goji nnenlum. Anv, nnenlum, nnenkal wo kpo fere jel-e. Nsol kpee lohng goji Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Tiren antahng go, anv, nꞌnob re nnenkal kak ero ka Esowo, kꞌbulu esi ejea? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Anv, go amahr nyaka nyaka, ń nehme ma nyehn re, li ejum ndon ka nnenlum re, alv esi tahb-e jvva? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Nnenkal no alv lꞌfere tahb-e, á bahke geere na. Tibre alabelabe alv enye Esowo ka-e ana ejum elbulu esi.<verse eid="1CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌseb re á lim nfaabe go alum nyaa, nong, á kahn re, ano e kpehme lim, a aneb ero bako go fvfo.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elkak ni elbuumu Ntul a Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Go etoono erehke jia, wahn n nehme tehk. Tibre akon enyahne nya ń kpo lim re kak-n ebo, kpꞌfere rannge na.<verse eid="1CO 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Go ngbokambang, bo tong-m re wahn ebyab, jol agꞌgabe agꞌgabe. Me m bum re, li ma jol etingitingi. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Tibre ḿ bahke tiki jol agꞌgabe agꞌgabe, eji bo lꞌliingi ane bao ba li atingitingi ane.<verse eid="1CO 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ngare nyi ń kpo je song kono edi ajehng, elkak ni elbuumu Ntul a Jisos sang ń kpo song li. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ane bandiki kpo ko nsol alehke ebo ba li go esamahr ane bako, jol nnene bo nehm sik, wo fere jo bꞌbuumu. Nne nondiki li o, njal kp-e yame.<verse eid="1CO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Anv, ntahk ń kpimm na, nyi ḿ bahke jo li nsol, fere wo alahba? Ń kpo daange aneb Esowo, fere jo riki akpak ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:5-6</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:22">Jen ji m bahke bꞌbung a nahne anv? Anv, me n tehk-n naa, afi? Eꞌee, wahn n nehm tehk. <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Nsol nyi n kpili goji Ntul a Jisos, nyi nyi n yahk-n tib a. Atv mao ma bo gungu Ntul a Jisos, á rodo ebred. <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />Eji á ma kak Esowo saam, á kehm bakke, kehm bungu re, “A wo li ngubjing enyame nyi bo ma bakke ka-n. Jo limen anaana, eji ń lꞌjo buum-m.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Eji bo ma li nsol mal, á kehm kpe rod nkob, kehm bungu re, “Nkob nyia nyi li egbanngalung ji nfenfe ji alung emame. Jo limen ana go egame elbuumu ngare anyehng anyehng nyi ń lꞌjo wo go nkob nyia.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 14:22-24</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi ń jo li ebred jia, fere wo go nkob nyia, ń kpꞌtiingi etib bi elkv ni Ntul a Jisos, tete á feere ba.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌli ebred jio, fere wo go nkob nyio nyi Ntul a Jisos, eji á ki lim go mbang nyi nno, á bahke lehke ebi, goji á ma lim abiafem, soodo ngubjing nyi Ntul a Jisos, fere soodo alung ma Jisos. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Nong, nne tohko jo gbo mbang rab ala enye, kehm jo li ebred jio, fere wo go nkob nyio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 26:22; 2 Kor 13:5</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌli, fere wꞌwo, kꞌbum re ngubjing nyi Kraist nyi, li ana á ma li, fere lung elam tv elne. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Owo wahnge egom ejahne gbalee kil eltahne, egom jindiki gbalee kpo yam, jindiki kpo. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Li re e kpꞌlame elnahre antahng, kehn Esowo wahr nehm lam. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Jehova lꞌlam-r, jia lohngo re, á kpi-r erem kak, eji e lꞌkꞌli ebi semme a njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 12:5-6</char></note><verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Abonanee, nobo re ń lꞌba kono edi ajehng re ń yahke li elkak ni elbuumu Ntul a Jisos, jo jiin sik ate ebahne. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Nne awohng awohng no njal lꞌyam-e, á jo li nsol go etahk, eji á lꞌkꞌba nkon, fere li ebi. Nsol nyehko nyi kpe li budu, n lꞌba go, ba toobo, n kehm-n tongo.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayare nya etohko ji Esowo kpo yare nne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Abonanee, n kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn go etingitingi bade ayare nya etohko ji Esowo kpo yare nne.<verse eid="1CO 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Ń kpꞌkahne re, ngare nyio nyi ń kala kahn Esowo, eblom bi kil jo bung bi jo fil-n, bi bi jo wahng ń jo jen ana akamma ane. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Owo wahnge no n kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn re, nne awohng awohng limm, no kpꞌjene go etohko ji Esowo, no bahke suku Jisos. Nnene limm, no bahke ma bung re, “Jisos Ntul wo”, tohko tiki jol re, etohko ji Esowo ji jolo a ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 9:39; 1 Jon 4:2-3</char></note><verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Ajoobo ayare nya etohko nyaa gbalee. Etohko na ajehng ajꞌjehng ji kpo ka ayare nyao. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ajoobo abang nyaa tvv, nya Ntul aloko. Li Ntul na awohng awꞌwohng no e kpo lok-e. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ajoobo ane baa, ba Esowo kpo ko bo lim ajoobo ntum enye. Esowo bꞌnehm bi kpo lim nsol nyia kpee.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Nne awohng awohng ebbel ayare enye nya Etingi Etohko m-e ka, eji lꞌnob ka ane kpee. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Etohko jꞌnehm ji kpo lim nne noko jo bung alum nya nne a ngbere, jꞌnehm ji kpo tob lim nne noko jo bung alum elkahne, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />jꞌnehm ji kpo tob ka nne noko eltaame, jꞌnehm ji kpo tob ka nne noko nsahm nyi elimanenob ayam ebo, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />fere ka nne noko nsahm nyi akpokosi alimi, ka nne noko enyehnamahr ji Esowo, ka nne noko elkahne ni á bahke jo liingi etohko ji Esowo, fere liingi atohko nyandiki, fere lim nne noko jo bung ajoobo ajahbe nfenfe, fere ka nne noko elkahne ni á bahke jo tooro ana alum nyao lohngo no. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Etohko jꞌnehm na ajehng ji kpo ka ayare nyaa, á kpo yare nne awohng awohng ana kor-e no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:3; Ef 4:7</char></note><verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngubjing anyehng nyi kpi ajoobo gbalee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kraist li ana ngubjing anyehng nyi kpi ajoobo gbalee. Li ngubjing na anyehng anyꞌnyehng, jol eji kpi kpi ajoobo gbalee. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Go etohko na ajehng wo, e ma bel ewohngalahb, fere jol ngubjing anyehng, wahr ane kpee, Jus, a Grik, a aju, go ane ba ki li aju. Wahr kpee bo ma-r ka etohko na ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:28</char></note><verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Tibre ngubjing kpimm ejoobo ejum ajehng, kpi ajoobo gbalee. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ekpade lꞌtong re, “Eji n ki li ebo, me ejum ngubjing sang,” lohngem re, ano wo bahke wahnge ka ekpade lꞌkꞌkpe jol ejum ngubjing. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Etung lꞌfere tong re, “Eji n ki li elmahr, me ejum ngubjing sang,” lohngem re, ano wo bahke wahnge ka etung lꞌkꞌkpe jol ejum ngubjing. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Li re ngubjing kpee kpi amahr amahr, kehn á bahke ma wuk renan? Li re ngubjing kpee kpi atung atung, kehn á bahke ma wuk esꞌsvv renan?<verse eid="1CO 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Esowo kake ejum ngubjing ajehng ajehng edi ji kor-e no. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Li re ngubjing li ejumjum ajehng, kehn jolem jolo ngubjing.<verse eid="1CO 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ana wo li no, kpi ajoobo gbalee, wo ngubjing anyehng nyi li no. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Elmahr nehm ma tong ebo re, “Wa n nehme seb.” Esi nehm ma tong ekpade re, “Wa n nehme seb.”<verse eid="1CO 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />A lꞌkpur nyehn, ano limm, ejum ngubjing jio ji lenge lenge, ji ji li etahntahn ejum. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Ejum ngubjing ji kil jo lub, ji ji e kpo ga kpunu. Ejum ngubjing ji ki fuumu re jol gbuul, ji ji ga kpi ano. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Wo, ejum ngubjing ji li gbuul kpehme seb ano. Eji Esowo limi ngubjing, á ka ejum ngubjing ji kil-r ga lub ekpunu sehnge ejum jehko, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />eji nyꞌyabe anyehng anyehng lꞌkꞌjol go ngubjing, eji ejum ngubjing ajehng ajehng lꞌjo kak ejum jehko ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:3</char></note><verse eid="1CO 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ejum ngubjing ajehng lꞌnyehn erem, ngubjing kpee bahke nyehne erem. Ejum ngubjing lꞌbel ellub, ngubjing kpee bahke bele eyebatahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:15</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Wahn ane kpee, ngubjing nyi Kraist nyi. Nne awohng awohng ewahne li ejum ngubjing nyio. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Go ero, Esowo gbo mbang yehke abatiingetib, kehm kpe yehke abanyehnamahr, fere yehke atꞌtibi, go ane ba kpo lim akpokosi, go ane ba kpo lim ane nob ayam ebo, a ane ba kpo kak ebo go eltum, a ane ba kpo fili ane, budu ane ba kpo bung ajoobo ajahbe nya nfenfe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:11-12</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Anv, ane kpee abatiingetib baa? Afi ane kpee anyehnamahr ba? Afi ane kpee atꞌtibi ba? Anv, ane kpee ba kpo lim akpokosia? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Anv, ane kpee ba kpo mal ane lim, bo nob ayam eboa? Anv, ane kpee ba kpo bung ajahbe nyandika? Afi ane kpee ba kpo tooro ana alum nyao lohngo no?<verse eid="1CO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Jo noken, eji ń lꞌbel ayare nyao nya ga tahne. Anv, m bahk-n tibi mbang nyi ga nob.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Bade elkoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />N lꞌbung go ajahbe nfenfe, fere jo bung alum enjel, kꞌbel elkoro, n li ana esoongo ji kpo lim ewok ewok, fere jol ana egbang bi kpꞌgbiki na gbik.<verse eid="1CO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Afi m bele nsahm nyi amahr anyehne, fere jo kahn ejum ajehng ajehng ji li mbehr mbehr, fere bel ellennge kpee, bel eltaame kpee ni bahke jo melle awong, kꞌbel elkoro, n tohkem lꞌli ejumjum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:22; 17:20</char></note><verse eid="1CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Afi n yake nsol enyame kpee ka go, fere yake elname ka re bo jahm-m fi, kꞌbel elkoro, nsehng anyehng anyehng limm, nyi m bahke lehke.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:27</char></note><verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Elkoro ni kpo lim nne á mal elkpooro, fere jol soom. Elkoro kpimm ala ateele, kpimm ejum nnyo aworo, kpimm elgeere. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Nne lꞌbel elkoro, á kpehme lim esabsab eljini. Á kpehme lim mbang nyꞌnye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:4,21</char></note> Eltim we kpehme rak sohk sohk. Á kpehme kud afem kak ala. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Á kpehme geere kak ebi ejum. Á kpo geere kak ejum ji nno.<verse eid="1CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Nne lꞌbel elkoro, á kpo kpuumu ejum ajehng ajehng. Á kpo taame tv ejum ajehng ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 24:14</char></note> Á kpi ekunukpu go ejum ajehng ajehng. Á kpo kpooro go mbang anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Elkoro esꞌkohlo kpimm. Enyehnamahr bahke male. Elbungu go ajahbe nfenfe bahke male. Elkahne fvfo bahke tob mal. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Tibre ellennge enahre, a enyehnamahr ejahre nehm biingi go nseenga nseenge.<verse eid="1CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ji biingi go nseenge lꞌsi bꞌba, ji ki biingi bahke male.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Eji n jolo mmonse, n jo bungu ana mmonse, fere jo tir ana mmonse, fere jo lim ese. Eji m ma gbal, jol nne, n kehm soro yake nsol ese nyio tv go.<verse eid="1CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Anv, e kpꞌfahnge go enyehn, jo nyehn advrehndv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:7</char></note> Ngare nyio e bahke nyehne saang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:2</char></note> Anv, ejang ji n kpꞌkahne. Efung bio bi m bahke kahne kpee, ana Esowo kp-m tob kahn kpee.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Nsol nyia na era nyi bahke sake, eltaame, ekunukpu, a elkoro. Elkoro ni ga gbal sehnge nsol nyehko kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:10</char></note><verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ayare nya Etingi Etohko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Jo noken, eji ń lꞌbel elkoro. Gbehden, eji ń lꞌtob bel ayare nyao nya Etingi Etohko, asehngesehnge ayare nya enyehnamahr ji Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Tibre nne no lꞌbung, eji á ma bel ayare nya elbungu go ejahbe jindiki, á kpehme bung a ane, á kpo bung a Esowo. Tibre nnene limm, no kpo wuk ana á kpꞌbungu, eji á kpo bung alum nya li mbehr mbehr, nya Etingi Etohko m-e ka. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Nne no lꞌnyehn amahr, á kpo bung tong ane, lim bo, bo gbal, kak bo ebo, fere kak bo eltim. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Nne no lꞌbung alum ejahbe jindiki, ye kpo kak elne ebo ntahngtahng. Nne no lꞌnyehn amahr, á kpo kak aneb ero kpee ebo. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Kp-m koro re wahn ane kpee, wahn bung go ajahbe nyandiki. Kp-m gaka kor re, wahn ane kpee, wahn jol abanyehnamahr Esowo. Nne no lꞌnyehn amahr, ye wo ga kak ebo sehnge nne no kpo bung go ajahbe nyandiki, sehngem re nne nondiki noa, no bahke ma tooro, eji lꞌkak aneb ero kpee ebo.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Abonanee, n lꞌba go egahne, fere jo ba bung go ajahbe nyandiki, nnoobo anyi m bahk-n kake? Sehngem re no, m ba, ba tiing-n etib bi Esowo ma lennge ka-m, fere ka-n elkahne, fere ba nyehn amahr tong-n, fere jo tib-n.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Jol nsol nyi ki kpi elkpin ana efiri abola ebuk, nne tohko ma kub, á lꞌjo gbehre na gbehre, nne bahke limi renan, kehm kahne ana á kpꞌkꞌkub? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Nne no kpi ntang wor, jo ku ane, á tohko ma wor, á lꞌwor aji aji, nnene limm, no bahke toobo ebjing bi á bahke tahme ebta. <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Ano wo tob li ka-n. Ń lꞌbung go ajahbe nyandiki nya ane kil elwuku, bahke limi renan, nne kehm kahne ji ń kpꞌbungu? Tibre ń kpꞌbungu na kak go elfeb.<verse eid="1CO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ajoobo alum nyaa gbalee go ajahbe nya njini nyia a. Ejahbe ajehng ajehng limm, ji alum ebo ki lohng ejum. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Nne no lꞌlohng ejahbe jimongo lꞌkehme elbungu, n tohko ma wuk ejahbe jio, n nehm wuk ji nne ejahbe noo kpꞌbungu. Ye nehm wuk ji me n kpꞌbungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Ano wo tob li ka wahnfono antahng. Ana ń kpꞌnoko re wahn bel ayare nya Etingi Etohko, gbehden, eji ń lꞌbel ayare nyao nya kpo lim aneb ero gbal.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Nong, nne no kpꞌbungu go ejahbe jindiki jo kak ero, eji á lꞌbel ayare nyao nya á bahke ma tooro ana lohngo no. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />N lꞌkehme ero kak go alum ejahbe jindiki, etohko ejame ji kpo kak ero, ntir enyame kpehme kak ebo abehng abehng.<verse eid="1CO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Anv, jen ji m bahke limi? M bahke kake ero go egame etohko, fere kak ero go egama ntir. M bahke yimi ase go egame etohko, fere yim ase go egama ntir. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />A lꞌkak Esowo saam go ega etohko, bahke limi renan, nne noka noka no tob li ona, kehm taame re, “Emen” go ero bi a kake no, eji á ki kahn ji a bungu no? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Eji a jo kak ero bi a jo kak Esowo saam, afi nobo na, nne noko, ebo we a kakem nkpel anyehng anyehng.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />N kpꞌkake Esowo saam, tib eji me n kpo bung ajahbe nyandiki sehnge wahn ane kpee. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />N lꞌjol go ellong aneb ero, n kpo ga tir re me m bung alum alon nya ane bahke ma wuk, eji n lꞌmal tib ane, sehnge re me m bung alum ejahbe jindiki atahltahl nkpel ebal atahl awubu.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Abonanee, kana jo rod elnahne bum ana abonse go egahna ntir atahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:14</char></note> Jolen abonbili go abiafem alimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:19</char></note> Go egahna ntir, jolen anebkul. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Bo nyono go nwer Esowo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Jehova re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">M bahke koko ajahmjahm, go bo anyo wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">m bahke bungu a ane ebame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Jol bo m-e nehm wuungu atung.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Owo e bahke kahne re, ayare nya elbungu go ejahbe jindiki limm ka aneb Esowo, li ka ane ba ki li aneb Esowo, eji lꞌkper bo tib Esowo. Enyehnamahr ji Esowo ji ji li ka aneb Esowo, limm ka ane ba ki li aneb Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Lꞌfere jol nyi aneb ero kpee bahke bake, ba kono edi ajehng, nne awohng awohng lꞌjo bung go alum ejahbe jindiki, ane ba ki li aneb Esowo, afi ajenne lꞌba yel egahne ellong, bo nehm tir re, wahn ebgbo esahla? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ane kpee lꞌfere nyehn amahr nya Esowo, nne no ki li nne Esowo, afi njenne lꞌba yel, alum nya á wuku no bahk-e kehme ellame go ege atahng, á fere nyehn elne ana nne abiafem. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Ntir atahng nyi wob-e go ege eltim bahk-e lennge gbuul, á bahke gboko, kohk esamahr ebe go ndi, kak Esowo, fere jo bung re, “Esowo lohko li a nahne a, go etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:8</char></note><verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana fuumu re ero jol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Anv, abonanee, jen ji fuumu re wahn lim? Ń lꞌba, ba kono edi ajehng, no nne bel ejum. Nne noko yehke ese, nne noko tib alum Esowo, noko tiingi etib bi Esowo ma lennge ka-e, noko bung go alum ejahbe jindiki, noko jo tooro ana lohngo no. Nong, ejum ajehng ajehng jol ekakebo ka aneb ero. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Elbungu nio go ajahbe nyandiki, nong, jol ane abal, ane ara, noko gbo mbang, noko toono, nne awohng jo tooro. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nne awohng awohng tohko jol no bahke ma tooro, nong, nne awohng awohng belle, á kꞌkpe bung, á fere jo bung go ege eltim a Esowo.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Go amahr anyehne, nong, ane abal, ane ara jo bung, ane bako jo wuungu atung, joare alum nyao li nseenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:11; 1 Tes 5:21</char></note><verse eid="1CO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Nne no jehk no, Esowo lꞌka-e alum re á lennge, nong, nne no yim no kpꞌbungu rahke. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Wahn ane kpee ń li ma tooro enyehnamahr ji Esowo esenngesennge, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌkpili, alum nyao fere kak-e eltim. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Etohko jio ji abanyehnamahr Esowo kpi no wob bo go elwo. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Esowo kpehme lim nsol enye jokko jokko jokko. Á li Esowo bio bi elkoono.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Go ekpꞌkpa ero ajehng ajehng ji aneb Esowo lꞌsong kono, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />nobo re, anebkal jo belle. Fuumem re bo jo bung. Tibre anebkal sang kpo fili aneblum, ana ntahm nyi Moses bungu no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 2:12</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌseb re bo kahn, nong, bo jo bahb alum ebo go etahk. Tibre li ejum ndon sehng re, nnenkal jo bung go ekpꞌkpa ero.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Anv, wahn ba, alum Esowo lohng go egahna? Anv, wahn ba wahng ka alum Esowo ba noa? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtir re, ye nnyehnamahr Esowo wo, afi á tongo re, á kpi etohko ji Jehova, nong, á taame re, nsol nyi n kpꞌnyono a, atahm nya Jehova nya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 4:6</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌjol ntahnsi a nne, nong, á sa ano.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Abonanee, noken, wahn jo nyehn enyehnamahr ji Esowo. Kana sahde eyaame ji elbungu go alum ajahbe nyandiki. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Nong, ejum ajehng ajehng jol songo songo, fere nꞌnob.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Elnyahme ni Kraist nyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Abonanee, n kpꞌsebe re me m buum-n bada nnoobo etib bi n tiing-n no, bi ḿ ma taame tv, fere kpꞌtoono. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Etib bia ana bi ḿ ma wuk, ń lꞌsoro asi elbumu go etingitingi, bahk-n tahre, tohko jol ano, wahn ebtaame mbol mbol.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />N tohko gbo mbang tong-n nsol nyi n wuku no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:3">Kraist kpo ka-r tib esi abiafem enyahre, ana nwer Esowo bungu no.<verse eid="1CO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Á kpo, bo kpa-e kak. Nfung era,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:4">Esowo nyahm-e go elkv, ana nwer Esowo bungu no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 24:25-27</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Owo á kehm song kpiri Pita,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 24:34</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:5">kehm kpe song kpiri abatiingetib ebe, ewubu ane abal.<verse eid="1CO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Efung abehng á kehm kpe song kpiri abatꞌtoono bako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:6">ane atahltahl atahl alon sꞌsehnge.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 15:6">Egom ebo jindiki gbalee jia, kpeke li go elkpin, jindiki ebkpo. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Owo á kehm song kpiri Jems, kpe song kpiri abatiingetib ebe kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 16:14</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Esꞌkohro, á kehm gohro ba kpiri me ji li ana nne no bo jel-e eji ngare ma sehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 9:5</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Me wo li nkahlanjahm a nne go ellong abatiingetib Jisos. N tohkem fꞌfuumu re bo lung-m re ntiingetib a Jisos, tibre n jo nohko aneb ero ba Esowo sehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 3:8</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Nnoobo nyi Esowo nyi wahnge n li ana li li a. Nnoobo nyi á ka-m no, m-e á kaam mbol mbol. Ń lꞌfere nyehn, ga, me n lim eltum sehnge nne awohng awohng go ellong abatiingetib Jisos. Jol me sang na, nnoobo nyi Esowo nyi li a name nyi. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Afi jolo bo, afi fere jolo me, ana e kpo bung, ano wo ḿ ma tob taame.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elnyahme ni e bahke nyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Eji e kpo bung alum Esowo re, Kraist ebnyahme go elkv, jen ji wahnge egom ejahne jindiki kpo bung re, akvne nehm nyahme go elkv?<verse eid="1CO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Akvne tohko nyahme go elkv, lohngo re, Kraist nyahmem go elkv nkpel anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Lꞌjol re Kraist nyahmem go elkv, lohngo re, alum Esowo nya e kpꞌbungu li mbol mbol, eltaame enahne fvfo tob li mbol mbol.<verse eid="1CO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Lꞌjol etingitingi re, akvne nehm nyahme go elkv, lohngo re, e kpꞌkimi efahnge lake Esowo, tibre e kpo yiimi ntianse re, Esowo nyahme Kraist go elkv, ye ji á ki-e nyahme. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Re akvne kꞌnyahme go elkv, lohngo re, Kraist nyahmem go elkv.<verse eid="1CO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Li re Kraist nyahmem go elkv, kehn lohngo re, eltaame enahne li mbol mbol, abiafem enyahne nyaa, kpeke wob go egahne atahng. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Ebtob lohng re, ane ba taame tv Kraist kehm kpoko, bobkpo tan. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Li re ekunukpu ejahre ji e kpꞌkunu re, Kraist bahk-r kake nnoobo, nnoobo nyio lꞌfere jol ka elkpin ni e li a ni anv ni ni, kehn e kpꞌfili ane ndon sehnge nne awohng awohng.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Li etingitingi re, Kraist eblohko nyahme go elkv, ana ngbokambang a nne no ma gbo mbang nyahme go ellong akvne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:18</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Ana nne awohng wahnge no elkv ba go njini, ano wo fvfo nne awohng ma tob wahng elnyahme go elkv ma tob ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:12-19</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ana Adam wahnge no nne awohng awohng bahke kpoko, ano wo fvfo nne awohng awohng bahke tiki bel elkpin tib esi ji Kraist.<verse eid="1CO 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Nne awohng awohng bahke nyahme go ege a ngare. Kraist wo jolo ngbokambang. Ane bao ba li ka Kraist, bo bahke nyahme ngare nyi á lꞌba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 4:16-17</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Owo esꞌkohro ngare bahke kehm rehnge, nyi Kraist bahke taare etul abehng abehng, fere radde atubesi kpee go bo a ntum, fere taare ellub anehng anehng. Owo á bahke kehm faake nji etul enye ka Esowo Nsoo.<verse eid="1CO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Tibre Kraist bahke tiki fili adi kpee, tete á bob anebekv ebe kpee, kunu bo akpade. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Nnekv no á bahk-e gohro rannge, elkv ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 20:14</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re, “Esowo ebrod ejum ajehng ajehng bum-e re á kunu akpade.” Eji nwer Esowo bungu re, “Ejum ajehng ajehng,” alum nyaa lohngem re, Esowo bi wob Jisos go elwo, tibre Esowo bi yake nsol nyio kpee, kak-e go elwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Eji nsol kpee bahke woomo Kraist go elwo, ano wo fvfo Kraist bahke tob woomo Esowo go elwo, bi yake nsol kpee kak-e go elwo, eji Esowo lꞌfili kpe kpe.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Anv, ane bao mee, ba ma bel ewohngalahb tib go esi ji akvne? Lꞌjol re akvne kpehme nyahme, jen ji wahnge ane bao kpo bel ewohngalahb tib go bo esi?<verse eid="1CO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Jen ji wahnge e kpo kono elgboko yel go efin ngare anyehng anyehng? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Abonanee, n kpꞌkpoko efung abehng abehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:36; 2 Kor 4:10-11</char></note> N kpꞌbungu jia tib go elgeere ni n kpꞌgeere kak-n, eji n li ka Kraist Jisos Ntul ewahre.<verse eid="1CO 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />N kpꞌbungu anv go mbang nyi nne. Eji n jolo go Efesus, jo nok a “abibbib enyam bio”, nsehng anyi n li no? Lꞌjol re akvne kpehme nyahme go elkv, nong, wahr limen ana bo tubu elgan re, “Nong, wahr jo liin nsol, fere jo wꞌwo, tibre behna e bahke kpoko.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nong, nne ki-n nehm! Nne lꞌjo jen a abi ane, nnoobo eljini ene bahke yaange. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Nong, amahr enyahne jol sange sange, goji ń lꞌgbo ntir, rahke abiafem go ellimi. Li ejum ndon sehng re me n tong-n re, Egom ejahne jindiki Esowo, bo nehme kahn.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngubjing nyi e bahke bele, e lꞌnyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Nne nondiki li ma bahb re, “Akvne bahke nyahme renan? Elkohn ngubjing anyi bo bahke bele?”<verse eid="1CO 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Wo egboolo nne jia, ejum ji a lꞌbahm, tohko tiki bol, nehm tiki mahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:24</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ejum ji a kpo bahm go ndi, elrahnti sang, mmohk eti nyi, fundiki mmohk eti ana mmohk elkohl, fundiki mmohk eti nyindiki. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Esowo kpo ka mmohk eti anyehng anyehng eljini ngubjing nyꞌnye ana kor-e no. Mmohk eti anyehng anyehng kpi eljini ngubjing nyꞌnye eje eje. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Agubjing nya nsol nyi li go elkpin go njini nyia limm elkohnkohn anehng. Ane kpi elkohn agubjing nya bo. Enyam kpi elkohn agubjing nya bo. Nruk kpi elkohn agubjing nya bo. Nsahre fvfo tob kpi elkohn agubjing nya bo. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Agubjing nya ejahbetul Esowo nyaa. Agubjing nya njini nyia nyaa fvfo. Agubjing nya li go ejahbetul Esowo kpi ano nya bo eje eje. Agubjing nya li go njini nyia tob kpi ano nya bo eje eje. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Njul kpi ano nyanye eje eje. Ebareka tob kpi ano nyanye eje eje. Alonlo fvfo tob kpi ano nya bo eje eje. Go ellong alonlo, ano nya bo li nkohn a nkohn.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ano wo fvfo elnyahme ngubjing go elkv li no. Ngubjing nyi e kpo kpa kak ndi, bahke bolo. Ngubjing nyi ma nyahme go elkv nehm kpe bol. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Nyi bo ma kak ndi kpꞌsabe, nyi ma fere nyahme, ebbel ano. Nyi bo ma kak ndi, ebkpuk, fere leenge, nyi ma fere nyahme, ebtahne, fere bel nsahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:20-21</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ngubjing nyi bo ma kpa kak, li ngubjing nyehka nyehka, nyi ma fere nyahme li ngubjing ana nyi etohko. Ngubjing nyehka nyehka lꞌjol, lohngo re, ngubjing nyi etohko nyia, tob li. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re, “Ngbokambang a nne no bo jo lung-e re Adam, Esowo lim-e, ka-e elkpin.” Adam jehko ji gohro ba esꞌkohro, á li etohko ji kpo ka elkpin.<verse eid="1CO 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Etohko sang gbo mbang ba. Ngubjing nyi gbo mbang ba, etohko kehm bake. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Ngbokambang Adam, Esowo ko ndi mong-e. Etoono Adam, Ntul ewahre wo, no lohng go ejahbetul Esowo. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ana nne no Esowo ko ndi mong-e li no, ano wo fvfo ane ba tob lohng ndi li no. Ana nne ejahbetul Esowo noo li no, ano wo fvfo ane ba ejahbetul Esowo tob li. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ana e li anv go elfoongo ni nne no Esowo mong-e go ndi, ano wo fvfo e bahke tob jol go elfoongo ni nne ejahbetul Esowo noo.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Abonanee, n kp-n tongo jia ana, tibre ngubjing nyehka nyehka nyi kpi alung nehm tiki yel go ejahbetul Esowo. Nsol nyi bahke bolo nehm tiki yel edi ji nsol nyi lꞌkꞌtiki bol bahke jolo.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Wuungen atung, me n tong-n nkpokosi ejum. Wahr ane kpee, e nehm kpo na kpo kpee, wahr ane kpee bahke yaange,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 4:15-17</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />elwaare elwaare, bahke ware ana ejehbekpakemahr, ngare nyi e lꞌwuk esꞌkohro ntang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:31; Ell 10:7</char></note> Tibre bo bahke woro ntang nyi akvne bahke nyahme go elkv, fere ba bel ngubjing nyi lꞌkꞌtiki bol. Wahr kpee bahke yaange. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Jio ji kpo bol, bahke yaange, fere jol ji lꞌkꞌkpe tiki bol.<verse eid="1CO 15:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ngare nyio nyi jio ji kpo bol ma yaange, fere jol ji lꞌkꞌkpe tiki bol, jio ji kpo kpo ma yaange, fere jol ji lꞌkꞌkpe tiki kpo, owo alum nwer Esowo kehm jolo go etingitingi, nya bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:54">“Bobnok ebta sehnge elkv, elkv ebmal kpee.<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Elkv, ntahn wo á bahke noko ebta sehnge wahr me?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Elkv, etakelehk eja jꞌna?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Etakelehk ji elkv, abiafem nya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:23</char></note> Nsahm nyi abiafem, atahm nya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:13</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Me n kak Esowo saam, eji á ka-r Ntul a Jisos Kraist ji noko ebta ka-r, ga anebekv ebahre.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Owo abonanee, nobo re wahn jo yiimi tꞌtahne, eji nne lꞌki-n ma nyeenge go mbang anyehng anyehng. Yelen kꞌkahb go eltum Esowo, wahn jo lim, eji ń kpꞌkahne re, eltum ni ń kpꞌlimi ka Ntul ewahre, ń nehme lim mbol mbol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:36; Ell 22:12</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayare nya li ka aneb Esowo bako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Bade akpohko nya ń kpꞌtahbe re wahn song kak aneb Esowo bako ebo, ana n tongo aneb ero ba li go Galesa, tob limen ano fvfo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 2:10; 6:10; 2 Kor 8:7-12; Elt 11:29</char></note><verse eid="1CO 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ngbokambang efung go erahde, nne awohng awohng ewahne jo yehke akpohko ana á bele no, kuuru go, eji n lꞌba, ń lꞌkꞌtohko kpe ji, tahb na. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />N lꞌba, ba rehng go, owo m bahke tumu ane bao ba ḿ ma yehke bo, ka bo awer, eji bo lꞌko ayare enyahne, tahm a nya go Jeusalem. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Lꞌfere nob re me n tob je, bo li-m ma toono.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsol nyi Pol jo tir re á lim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />N lꞌrehng go Masedonia, m bahke soro rehng go egahne. Tibre mbang a Masedonia nyi m bahke sehnge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:21</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Ma m bahke kange a nahna nji. Ma n li ma ba, ba kang a nahne elkoko mal a nji, eji ń lꞌtv-m edi ajehng ajehng ji n lꞌkpe je.<verse eid="1CO 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Tibre n nehme seb re me n nyehn-n anv, eji n kpꞌsehnge na sehng. N kpꞌsebe re me n kang na abon afung a nahne, Jehova lꞌtaame. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />M bahke kange ga Efesus tete efung Pentikost rehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:1,10</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Tibre egburu eyake eltum eblennge ka-m, wo gana, anebekv baa gbalee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:8; Kol 4:3; 2 Kor 2:12</char></note><verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Timoti lꞌba go egahne, vvren ye. Tibre á kpo tob lim eltum Esowo jang jang ana n kpꞌlimi.<verse eid="1CO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nong, nne awohng awohng ki-e bum reed.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 4:12</char></note> Tvvn ye go eyebatahng, eji á lꞌfeere ba tob-m ga. Tibre n kp-e siki re á ba, a aneb Esowo bako go.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Mmonannee Apollos, n kpo rehk-e re á ba go egahne, a aneb Esowo bako. Anv, we nehme kor re á ba nkpel anyehng anyehng. Á lꞌbel eyake, á bahke bake.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alum nya Pol ko, kohro nwer nyia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Jo baaben! Yiimen tꞌtahne go egahne eltaame! Belen esahb, wahn bel nsahm! <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń kpꞌlimi, jo limen go elkoro.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Abonanee, ń kpꞌkahne re, Stefanas, a nlaaga enye, bo ba gbo mbang taame tv ntul a Jisos go Akaya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:5</char></note> Bobrod elbo kak go eltum Esowo, eji bo lꞌjo kak aneb Esowo ebo. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />N kp-n rehke re, wahn jo wuk elkohn ane ana bao, a nne awohng awohng no kpo tob lim eltum ana bo, fere jo loko.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Eltim ma-m yebe sehng, eji Stefanas, a Fortunatas, go Akaikus bo ma ba. Tibre bo ba li ane ba limi re, me m bel eyebatahng, eji ń ki li. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Bo ma-m kak eko, fere tob kak-n eko. Jo kaken ane ba li ana bo.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Aneb ero ba li go Esia tong-m re, me n kak-n nnyo. Akwila abola Priskilla nkal ewe, a aneb ero kpee ba kpo je song kono asi go etahk Akwila, bo tob tong-m re, me n kak-n nnyo go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:3-4</char></note><verse eid="1CO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Aneb ero kpee tongo re, me n kak-n nnyo. Eji ń kpꞌkake atemtem nnyo, jo soden atem anyo, ana abonanyehn nne.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Mefono antahng Pol, n kpꞌnyono nnyo akake mia go egame ebo. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Nne awohng awohng no Ntul a Jisos Kraist tohk-e kor, nkuk a ne!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 1:8-9</char></note> Maranata! (Ji lohngo re, Ntul ewahre, ba!)<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Nnoobo nyi Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre jol a nahne.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Elkoro ename ni Kraist Jisos jol a nahne wahn ane kpee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:24">Emen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>